{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/script/web.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-03T13:18:25.831873Z","id":"f133c6afaf310e928dd871aba57338c8bdbf2fd9d28fba941f366d5222b87f56","body":{"kind":"comment","ref":"git:0916ce826","references":"7f2e541540336c369c08b997a92510a6a6ad3f712f1f2b97bef7eab09176a929","summary":"Re-pointed after the branch's commits were re-signed: git:5dce9c70a is now git:0916ce826. Each replacement carries the same patch as the commit it replaces (git patch-id --stable matches).","tags":["session:claude-code:ad4c0f0d-1745-4445-8c27-3925ac4b061a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/script/web.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-03T13:18:25.832189Z","id":"f118e30b2b86d1495b91ff46c7b98cee42ebb17d5de0f1ff2cf043fe3171ab77","body":{"kind":"comment","ref":"git:0916ce826","references":"b402f3964706873684cebfd95a650b929d69ea02a97390e23ac416e2eb56a1bb","summary":"Re-pointed after the branch's commits were re-signed: git:5dce9c70a is now git:0916ce826. Each replacement carries the same patch as the commit it replaces (git patch-id --stable matches).","tags":["session:claude-code:ad4c0f0d-1745-4445-8c27-3925ac4b061a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/script/web.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-03T17:03:47.380026Z","id":"91b99567ec4f441c2c8ece7c6ca17e61363b802072395111030a8b7f631b6718","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:23c49852d","summary":"Fixed: host errors carry retryable end to end (HostError, both sandboxes, d.ts goldens). Tests a_web_error_says_whether_it_is_retryable_and_replays_so (//crates/clax-bot:integration) and the conformance case a_host_error_says_whether_it_is_retryable on QuickJS and the Worker Loader pass. just check at b44c2e9bc: 'Executed 53 out of 381 tests: 381 tests pass.' and 'bazel: all checks passed'.","supersedes":"98dd4c3100d1d2162500ebb36bbfb75759edfe48624b85b813642e2565d2895f","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:ad4c0f0d-1745-4445-8c27-3925ac4b061a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/script/web.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-03T17:03:47.527327Z","id":"a98f41a4e2a5497d232ab0b88840131408b55f08b27094d202e8d60668f790c3","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:4e7c0a275","summary":"Fixed: a fetch reads the run's journaled web calls with one query (Store::bot_web_calls) and the caps count in SQL (Store::bot_web_counts). Store tests the_runs_web_calls_are_read_at_once_in_order and the_runs_counted_web_calls_are_counted_by_op pass; existing replay and source tests pass unchanged. just check at b44c2e9bc: 'Executed 53 out of 381 tests: 381 tests pass.' and 'bazel: all checks passed'.","supersedes":"dd298dd78a289d8d104f6df05b37df9377c7545cb04a5a0e0c2a481aa29259c8","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:ad4c0f0d-1745-4445-8c27-3925ac4b061a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/script/web.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-03T17:03:47.675232Z","id":"bb3fb89da064cc9ad2531ed350ad571e15723a83f07d2e5f3d980d722b031740","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:23c49852d","summary":"Fixed: a failed call that reached the source stays uncharged but now counts toward the run's per-op cap (spec section 7.2). Test failed_calls_count_against_the_cap_uncharged_across_a_restart (//crates/clax-bot:integration) passes, with a cap of 3 so a double count across replay would fail it. just check at b44c2e9bc: 'Executed 53 out of 381 tests: 381 tests pass.' and 'bazel: all checks passed'.","supersedes":"511ba1f0fe22f3ca13ac462cd4227e5b127195d9d925613cbb7f0d16646b1168","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:ad4c0f0d-1745-4445-8c27-3925ac4b061a"]}}
